stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Detected : Observation ingested
    Detected --> Assessed : evt_incident_assessed [Auto-triage / Operator]
    Assessed --> RecommendationReady : evt_recommendation_generated [AI Orchestrator]
    
    RecommendationReady --> HumanApproved : evt_recommendation_approved [Supervisor]
    RecommendationReady --> HumanRejected : evt_recommendation_rejected [Supervisor]
    
    HumanRejected --> Assessed : Re-evaluate Context
    HumanApproved --> Actioned : evt_tasks_dispatched [Tasks active]
    
    Actioned --> Resolved : evt_incident_resolved [All tasks completed]
    Actioned --> Assessed : Re-dispatch Loop [Task execution failed]
    
    Resolved --> Learned : evt_learning_logged [Post-incident check]
